Package: phrindicators
Title: Public Health Indicator Construction Tools
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Saeed",
           family = "Rahman",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "saeed.rahman0@gmail.com")
Description: Provides add_* indicator-construction helpers for public health
    survey data. Core functionality covers food security (FSL/FCS/HDDS/LCSI/RCSI),
    nutrition (MUAC, z-scores, IYCF), mortality, WASH, and demographics,
    while validation and error-handling utilities are supplied by phrutils.
